# English product copy

User-facing strings in this repo are **English only**.

## Applies to

- Vue templates: labels, buttons, empty states, placeholders, `a-modal` / `a-popconfirm` titles
- `message.*` / toast / alert text in `apps/web`
- API `AppError` messages and other strings returned to the client
- Table column titles, tab names, status chip labels meant for humans

## Does not force

- Agent/LLM system prompts that intentionally speak Vietnamese for BA domain work (existing `baChat` prompts) — leave unless the task is explicitly translating those
- Comments in code (English preferred)
- Commit messages (English)

## When editing UI

1. Write new copy in English.
2. If the file still has Vietnamese UI strings on the same surface, translate them in the same change.
3. Prefer concise product English: "No active scripts", "Only the devops role can configure scripts".

```text
❌ Chưa có lệnh active. Sang tab Config để thêm hoặc bật lệnh.
✅ No active scripts. Open the Config tab to add or enable one.
```
